---
manual: slot.scroll_max
lines: [2444, 2451]
testability: visual
display: native
ledger: C5
----------- app code
Shoes.app width: 400, height: 300 do
  @list = stack width: 200, height: 100, scroll: true do
    5.times { stack height: 40 }
  end
end
----------- test code
list = stack("@list")
assert_in_delta 100, list.scroll_max, 0.5, "200 pixels of content minus one 100 pixel page"
assert_in_delta list.scroll_height - list.height, list.scroll_max, 0.5, "the same as scroll_height - height"
